# The Fluent-motion experiment on the Project board: the selected card fades as the cursor moves (truecolor).
Output board-motion.gif
Source tapes/common.tape
Set Framerate 50

Type "COLORTERM=truecolor gh-9s"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type ":"
Sleep 300ms
Type "fav"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "l"
Sleep 400ms
Type "l"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "b"
Sleep 2500ms

# the selection fades from card to card
Type "j"
Sleep 900ms
Type "j"
Sleep 900ms
Type "k"
Sleep 900ms
Type "l"
Sleep 1100ms
Type "j"
Sleep 900ms
Type "h"
Sleep 1500ms
